@startuml
title Renting School Facility - Activity Diagram

'Actors/Swimlanes listed in the following order
|Renter|
|Website|
|School Staff|
|Payment Service|
|Email Service|

|Renter|
start
:Choose facility, date, time, event type;

|Website|
:Check availability;
note right
  Website checks the selected
  facility, date, and time
end note
while (available?) is ([not available])
    :Show not available;
    |Renter|
    if (try another date?) then ([no])
        stop
        note right: Ends if renter declines to reselect
    else ([yes])
        :Choose different date;
    endif
    |Website|
    :Check availability;
endwhile ([available])

|Renter|
:Enter contact info;
:Submit request;

|School Staff|
:Review request;
if (decision?) then ([rejected])
    |Website|
    :Record rejection;
    |Email Service|
    :Send rejection email;
    stop
else ([approved])
    |Payment Service|
    :Charge renter;
    note left: Only charge after staff approval
    if (payment?) then ([payment succeeds])
        |Website|
        :Save booking;
        |Email Service|
        :Send confirmation email;
        stop
    else ([payment fails])
        |Website|
        :Record failure;
        |Email Service|
        :Send failure email;
        stop
    endif
endif
@enduml
